// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO8-11 (LoRa SPI bus), GPIO12-14 (LoRa
// RST/BUSY/DIO0), GPIO17/18/21 (OLED I2C), GPIO36 (Vext power-gate) -
// see vendor pins_arduino.h.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO35 deliberately left untagged - vendor pins_arduino.h
// (official Heltec-Aaron-Lee/WiFi_Kit_series repo) declares it as
// LED_BUILTIN/LED, but GPIO35 falls in the octal flash/PSRAM reserved
// range (GPIO33-37) already excluded from chipGpios at the ESP32-S3
// chip-level default (see ../board.json) and not present in this
// board's chipGpios - tagging it would mean re-adding an excluded pin,
// which is out of scope here. No onboard user button was confirmed in
// any Heltec documentation for this board (no BUTTON/PRG pin declared
// in pins_arduino.h, none described on heltec.org or docs.heltec.org).
